<title>FINLAND: Valmet Jan-April profit falls 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Valmet Jan-April profit falls 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   322 vs 374</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.00 vs 3.06</p>
<p> Net sales					  3,755 vs 3,705</p>
<p> Operating profit				   292 vs 314</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of eleven analysts' forecasts for Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy's profit after financial items had been 358 million markka in a 310-400 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Net financial items			  gain 26 vs 63 gain</p>
<p> Shares in associated companies'</p>
<p> results					   gain 4 vs 3 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			     226 vs 67</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			   nil vs 113</p>
<p> Profit before taxes				548 vs 328</p>
<p> Taxes						  160 vs 93</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 1 vs 3 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   387 vs 232</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Valmet Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245, news@reuter.fi</p>
